    "Id": "chassisdef_catapult_CPLT-QSK",
    "Name": "Catapult",
    "Details": "At Quicksell we always try to innovate. To that end, we proudly announce the CPLT-QSK! Designed to protect your assets from hostile missiles, our patented Laser AMS is the star of the show here! But that's not all! With the flip of a switch, the Laser AMS can be turned into a regular laser! Perfect for if anything slipped in under the radar.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Jammer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.07</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
